    <h1>Lead Generation For <span class="amber">Garden Room</span> Companies</h1>
    <p class="lede">Garden rooms are one of the fastest-growing jobs in the country: extra space without the cost and chaos of moving or extending. I get garden room companies across Scotland in front of homeowners who want one, with ads that show the finish and a funnel that filters the tyre-kickers.</p>
