      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Will homeowners ask about planning permission?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Some will, and that's a good sign they're serious. The funnel gathers the detail up front, so you're having those conversations with genuine prospects rather than answering the same questions for people who'll never book.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Do I need footage of my garden rooms?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">It's the strongest thing you can run. We come to you and film, or work from finished builds you've already got. Seeing a finished, insulated room in a real garden is what makes a homeowner picture their own.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Isn't this a seasonal job?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
